p. Click on the New Outcome button to create a new outcome, or the New Group button to create a new group to organise your outcomes into. The Find button will allow you to use outcomes that have been created by your organisation or institution. As you create and use outcomes you will be able to use the panel to the left to navigate through your outcomes. You can drag and drop outcomes between the different levels to create structure.\",\"page_50c4823d\":\"Page\",\"page_title_ascending_b5df950c\":\"Page title: Ascending\",\"page_title_descending_70c1483d\":\"Page title: Descending\",\"page_type_d1e0fec7\":\"page type\",\"pages_e5414c2c\":\"Pages\",\"pages_settings_968392a3\":\"Pages Settings\",\"paginated_collection.no_items\":\"No items.\",\"paginated_view.loading_more_results\":\"Loading more results\",\"people_navigation_tabs_631401fe\":\"People navigation tabs\",\"please_enter_a_search_term_of_3_or_more_characters_aed0b58f\":\"Please enter a search term of 3 or more characters\",\"pledge_text_can_t_be_blank_when_the_pledge_is_enab_fca598b6\":\"Pledge text can't be blank when the pledge is enabled\",\"pledge_text_is_too_long_maximum_is_1000_characters_2c86b890\":\"Pledge text is too long (maximum is 1000 characters)\",\"points_bb475533\":\"Points\",\"points_points_d0a0e879\":\"%{points} Points\",\"profile_picture_13e5338c\":\"Profile Picture\",\"profiles.gravatar_view.button.preview\":\"Preview\",\"profiles.gravatar_view.enter_gravatar_email_below\":\"enter your *Gravatar* email address below\",\"profiles.take_picture_view.retry\":\"Retry\",\"profiles.take_picture_view.take_picture\":\"Take picture\",\"publish_5211dca3\":\"Publish\",\"publish_aa888e3c\":\"Publish:\",\"publish_at_3fd340d1\":\"Publish At\",\"published_4bb5209e\":\"Published\",\"quiz_e0dcce8f\":\"Quiz\",\"quiz_settings_4e17f005\":\"Quiz settings\",\"quiz_survey_8557b649\":\"Quiz/Survey\",\"quizzes.index_view.links.manage_question_banks\":\"Manage question banks\",\"quizzes.index_view.links.publish_mu