 way to organise students for things like group projects or papers. Every student group gets their own calendar, discussion board and collaboration tools so they can organise themselves and work together more effectively.\",\"You can randomly assign students to groups of a specific size, or manually create and organize the groups. Once your groups are created, you can set assignments to be \\\\\"group submission\\\\\" assignments, which means each group will have one submission for all users of that group.\":\"You can randomly assign students to groups of a specific size, or manually create and organise the groups. Once your groups are created, you can set assignments to be \\\\\"group submission\\\\\" assignments, which means each group will have one submission for all users of that group.\"},\"groups_manage_group_category_detail\":{\"Clone Group Set\":\"Clone group set\",\"Randomly Assign Students\":\"Randomly assign students\",\"These groups are self-organized by students. Unlike other types of groups, students can belong to more than one of these groups at a time, so these groups cannot be used for graded assignments.\":\"These groups are self-organised by students. Unlike other types of groups, students can belong to more than one of these groups at a time, so these groups cannot be used for graded assignments.\"},\"groups_manage_group_category_edit\":{},\"groups_manage_group_users\":{},\"groups_manage_self_signup_help\":{\"You can create sets of groups where students can sign up on their own. Students are still limited to being in only one group in the set, but this way students can organize themselves into groups instead of needing the teacher to do the work. With this option enabled, students can move themselves from one group to another. However, you can set an end date to close self sign-up to prevent students from joining or changing groups after a certain date.\":\"You can create sets of groups where students can sign up on their own. Students are still limited to being in only one group in the set, but this way students can organise themselves into groups instead of needing the teacher to do the work. With this option enabled, students can move themselves from one group to another. However, you can set an end date to close self-sign-up to prevent students from joining or changing groups after a certain date.\",\"You can create sets of groups where students can sign up on their own. Students are still limited to being in only one group in the set, but this way students can organize themselves into groups instead of needing the teacher to do the work. With this option enabled, students can move themselves from one group to another. Note that as long as this option is enabled, students can move themselves from one group to another.\":\"You can create sets of groups where students can sign up on their own. Students are still limited to being in only one group in the set, but this way students can organise themselves into groups instead of needing the teacher to do the work. With this option enabled, students can move themselves from one group to another. Note that as long as this option is enabled, students can move themselves from one group to another.\"},\"jquery_module_sequence_footer\":{},\"modules_relock_modules_dialog\":{},\"outcomes_accessible_line_graph\":{\"The most recent scores for user {{current_user_name}} and outcome {{outcome_name}}.\":\"Most recent scores for user {{current_user_name}} and outcome {{outcome_name}}.\"},\"outcomes_calculation_method_example\":{\"Calculation Method\":\"Calculation method\"},\"outcomes_criterion\":{\"pts\":\"Pts\"},\"outcomes_criterion_header\":{},\"outcomes_outcome_form\":{\"Calculation Method\":\"Calculation method\",\"Total Points\":\"Total points\"},\"profiles_gravatar_view\":{},\"profiles_take_picture_view\":{\"Take Picture\":\"Take picture\"},\"quizzes_index_view\":{\"Create Quiz\":\"Create quiz\",\"Manage Question Banks\":\"Manage question banks\",\"Publish Multiple